## Project: Multimodal Healthcare Data Generator

This project generates synthetic multimodal healthcare data for research and development
in medical AI applications. It includes structured data (EHR), unstructured text (clinical notes),
and time-series medical data generation using advanced machine learning techniques.

### Features:
- Synthetic tabular healthcare data generation
- Time-series medical data synthesis
- Cross-modal data generation
- Privacy-safe datasets for AI/ML research
- Easy integration with healthcare analytics pipelines

### Author:
Dasari Ranga Eswar
GitHub: https://github.com/eswaroy

### Components (Included in Synthesis_main):
- Client: React-based frontend for data visualization and configuration
- Server: Python/Flask backend with ML service integration
- ML Service: Advanced GAN-based data generation models

For more information, visit: https://github.com/eswaroy/synthieis
